Aṅgada meets Kampana and fells him with mountain peak --- Routed Rākṣasas rally around Kumbha --- Kumbha fells Dvivida and Mainda with serpent arrows --- Kumbha pierces Aṅgada and cuts his trees and rocks --- Rāma sends Jāmbavān and chiefs to rescue Aṅgada --- Kumbha checks rescuers with arrow flood --- Sugrīva hurls mountains breaks Kumbha bow and praises his valor --- Sugrīva exchanges vajra fists and fells Kumbha